        "t2": {
          "required_tools": [
            "orders_update"
          ]
        }
      },
      "rubricNotes": "Trunk consolidates note + status changes into orders_update (customer_note arg). Both turns hit orders_update — t1 with customer_note, t2 with status='on-hold'. Per-turn auto_decline_writes=false so the harness explicitly approves both writes; this avoids the inherent flakiness where t2 short-circuits because the model remembers a t1 decline under a global auto-decline default. Acceptable failure mode: model proposes orders_update on t2 but harness/resolver yields a decline outcome - the proposal itself is what t2 invariants check."
    },
